# ⚽ Predict11

> AI-powered football match prediction platform.

Predict11 is a full-stack web application that uses Machine Learning to predict football match outcomes and explain the reasoning behind each prediction.

---

## 🚀 Features (Planned)

- Match predictions
- Team statistics
- Historical data analysis
- Explainable AI
- Interactive dashboards
- AI Agent for football analysis

